  "body": "If you're looking for a home where everything has been done, the living is easy and entertaining is a dream, this beautifully presented home is sure to impress!\r\n\r\nBuilt in 2020, this stylish single-level home offers 200sqm of thoughtfully designed living on a beautifully landscaped 651sqm freehold section, with greenbelt views.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is a stunning, spacious kitchen, complete with a pantry and charming barn door feature. Flowing seamlessly into the open-plan dining and lounge, the light flooring and soft, neutral tones create a fresh, bright and welcoming atmosphere.\r\n\r\nEntertaining is where this home really shines! Step outside to an impressive covered deck, complete with a louvre roof and pull-down blinds, creating the perfect all-season entertaining space. Enjoy the greenbelt outlook, or head down to the private, covered spa pool area for a little relaxation.\r\n\r\nFour bedrooms offer space and versatility for the whole family, including two generously sized master suites, each complete with its own walk-in wardrobe and ensuite. The main master suite enjoys direct access to the entertaining deck, while the second is cleverly positioned separately from the other bedrooms, with its own ranch slider access to the outdoors. Perfect for extended family, guests or those who appreciate a little extra privacy and independence.\r\n\r\nMore to love:\r\n- Easy single-level living\r\n- Central heating for year-round comfort\r\n- Double internal-access garage with built-in laundry\r\n- Generous linen cupboard and additional under-house storage\r\n- Beautifully landscaped, low-maintenance gardens with room for a trampoline\r\n- Everything completed and ready to enjoy!\r\n\r\nThe location is just as appealing! Just a short drive from Orewa's stunning beach, vibrant cafés, restaurants and shops. With great schooling options, scenic walking and cycling trails, Silverdale's shopping facilities and convenient motorway access nearby, you'll love the balance of relaxed coastal living and everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nThe owners have moved overseas and are seriously selling! This home will soon be vacant and ready for its next chapter, here's your opportunity to move in and settle before the festive season. Ignore the CV, make your owner to our motivated vendors.\r\n\r\nNothing to do, just move in, unpack and enjoy!\r\n\r\nCome and experience the lifestyle waiting for you at 125 Godfrey Drive, Orewa.\r\nDownload the documents here: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/Q7BM",
